<main>

  <!-- WHAT WE DO -->
  <section>
    <p class="sec-label">What we do</p>
    <h2>We study companies and talk<br>to the people behind them</h2>
    <p class="sec-lead">We invite people from businesses to join our meetings and present them a picture of reality that we can build after doing research. Then we create stories in teams that cover three perspectives: Company, Market and Business model. This is followed by Q&amp;A sessions and discussion.</p>
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="card story-card">
        <div class="card-top-line"></div>
        <div class="story-card-num">
          <span class="diamond-xs"></span>
          <span class="story-num-label">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Company Story</h3>
        <p>What the company does, how it operates, and how it grew.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card story-card">
        <div class="card-top-line"></div>
        <div class="story-card-num">
          <span class="diamond-xs"></span>
          <span class="story-num-label">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Market Story</h3>
        <p>The market the company operates in, its competitors, and how it positions itself.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card story-card">
        <div class="card-top-line"></div>
        <div class="story-card-num">
          <span class="diamond-xs"></span>
          <span class="story-num-label">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Business Model Story</h3>
        <p>How value is created and delivered.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
